for the services, particularly in areas like shipping, logistics, warehousing, and freight forwarding and the overall efficiency of the supply chain.^Analysing this data can offer insights into the adequacy and efficiency of port infrastructure and the impact of trade policies and international agreements on maritime commerce."},{"question":"How to interpret the Port Cargo Traffic data?","answer":"High volumes suggest robust import and export activities, which are vital for economic growth.^Long-term trends in this data can indicate the health of global trade connections and the economy’s openness to international markets."},{"question":"What does the Port Cargo Traffic data represent?","answer":"Port Cargo Traffic data measures the volume of cargo handled by a country's seaports over a specific period.^This includes the total tonnage of goods loaded, unloaded, imported, and exported through maritime transport."}],"related":[{"slug":"baltic-dry-index","title":"Baltic Dry Index"},{"slug":"crude-oil-price-indian-basket","title":"Crude Oil Price (Indian Basket)"},{"slug":"external-commercial-borrowings-ecbs","title":"External Commercial Borrowings (ECBs)"},{"slug":"foreign-exchange-reserves","title":"Foreign Exchange Reserves"},{"slug":"foreign-tourist-arrivals","title":"Foreign Tourist Arrivals"},{"slug":"gross-foreign-direct-investment-fdi","title":"Gross Foreign Direct Investment (FDI)"},{"slug":"gross-foreign-portfolio-investment-fpi","title":"Gross Foreign Portfolio Investment (FPI)"},{"slug":"import-cover-months","title":"Import Cover (Months)"},{"slug":"international-air-passenger-traffic","title":"Air Passenger Traffic - International"},{"slug":"non-oil-exports","title":"Non-Oil Exports"},{"slug":"services-trade-net-inflows","title":"Services Trade- Net Inflows"}],"title":"Port Cargo Traffic","description":"India's port cargo traffic stands at 77.4 Million Tonnes for Aug 2026. This physical indicator often confirms or contrasts with trade balance data.","headli